<title>USA: Wickes completes sale/leaseback deal.</title>
<headline>Wickes completes sale/leaseback deal.</headline>
<dateline>VERNON HILLS, Ill. 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wickes Inc said Monday it has completed a $7.3 million sale/leaseback deal on its headquarters facility.</p>
<p>An affiliate of Bradley Associates, a Chicago-based real estate investment company, purchased the 72,000-square foot site. Wickes will lease the entire building at market rates, and has sub-leased 20,000 square feet to ERM North Central Inc for 20 years.</p>
<p>Wickes said it will recognize a gain of about $700,000 over the term of the lease. The proceeds will be used to reduce bank debt.</p>
<p>Wickes Inc, formerly Wickes Lumber Co, supplies building materials in the United States.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
